        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Electroacoustics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nELECTROACOUSTIC TRANSDUCER MAP\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-ELECTROACOUSTICS.md#004",
      "path": [
        "06-ELECTROACOUSTICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
