        "root_concepts": "[electroacoustics]",
        "section": "acoustics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Electroacoustics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ACOUSTIC ──────────────────────────────────────────► ELECTRICAL\n  │                 TRANSDUCTION                          │\n  │                 MECHANISMS                            │\n  │                                                       │\n  │   Electromagnetic (dynamic)    Moving coil in field   │\n  │   Electrostatic (condenser)    Moving plate in field  │\n  │   Piezoelectric                Mechanical strain      │\n  │   Magnetostrictive             Magnetic strain        │\n  │   Electret                     Permanent polarization │\n  │                                                       │\n  ▼                                                       ▼\nPressure wave                               Electrical signal\n(Pa, m/s)                                   (V, A, W)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-ELECTROACOUSTICS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "06-ELECTROACOUSTICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:acoustics:06-electroacoustics, git-history:acoustics:06-electroacoustics]",
