        "current_path": "acoustics/06-ELECTROACOUSTICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:acoustics:electroacoustics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "acoustics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[electroacoustics]",
        "section": "acoustics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Electroacoustics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RECIPROCITY PRINCIPLE:\nAny transducer that converts acoustic → electrical also works in reverse.\nDynamic microphone ↔ Dynamic loudspeaker (same physical principle)\nCondenser microphone ↔ Electrostatic loudspeaker\nPiezo microphone ↔ Piezo speaker (buzzer, ultrasonic transducer)\n```"
    },
