      "text": "SMALL DIAPHRAGM vs LARGE DIAPHRAGM:\nSmall (< 1/2\" capsule): better transient response, flatter off-axis response\nLarge (≈ 1\"): warmer sound, more sensitive, character (KM84/AKG 414)\n```"
