      "text": "┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n            │                                         │\n            │  Spider ─►[Voice coil]◄─ Spider         │\n            │           Motor: B·l·I = Force          │\n            │  Force moves diaphragm (cone or dome)   │\n            │                                         │\n            │  [Cone/dome diaphragm]                  │\n            │  │                                      │\n            │  └──► Acoustic radiation                │\n            └─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n  Input AC drives the voice coil from the left."
